<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Panavision upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panavision upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it upgraded Panavision Inc to outperform from perform in line.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 at 18-5/8.</p>
